### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

###
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### Buscar todos os médicos
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllMedicos HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Buscar médico por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getMedicoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Inserir médico
POST http://localhost:40000/insertMedico HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "crm": "CRM-SP 111222",
    "nome": "Mariana Costa",
    "salario": 21000.75,
    "dataadmissao": "2024-02-15",
    "especialidadeid": 3
}

### Atualizar médico
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateMedico/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "crm": "CRM-SP 123456",
    "nome": "Ana Paula Souza Ramos",
    "salario": 19000.00,
    "dataadmissao": "2020-03-10",
    "especialidadeid": 1
}

### Excluir (soft delete) médico
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteMedico/3 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
